{
  "id": "frost_vigdis_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A tarpaulin, a fire that is mostly smoke, and a woman sorting bone into three piles by some system of her own."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buying or looking? Looking's free. Standing where I'm sorting isn't.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "frost_vigdis_cut",
          "text": "These have been cut. What does that out here?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "frost_strand_cut"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                11,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_ice_moot",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "frost_vigdis_cut_told",
            "onFailure": "frost_vigdis_cut_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "frost_vigdis_inland",
          "text": "They are all lying the same way round.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "frost_strand_inland"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                12,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_ice_moot",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "frost_vigdis_inland_told",
            "onFailure": "frost_vigdis_inland_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "frost_vigdis_ribs",
          "text": "Those bones standing out of the Strand. You sleep next to them.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "frost_strand_ribs"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_ice_moot",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "frost_vigdis_ribs_told",
            "onFailure": "frost_vigdis_ribs_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "frost_vigdis_cut_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She holds one up without being asked twice — she has clearly wanted somebody to look at it. “One stroke. No chatter, no saw marks, no wedge. I have taken bone apart for nine years and I could not do that with anything I own.” She puts it back on the pile. “The Landing says ice. Ice does not do that either.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "frost_strand_cut"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "frost_vigdis_cut_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "frost_vigdis_cut_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_ice_moot",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "frost_vigdis_cut_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "frost_vigdis_inland_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Facing in. Every one, and I have moved a lot of them.” She is quiet a moment. “I stopped turning them back after the first winter. They were facing in again by the spring and I would rather not know how.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "frost_strand_inland"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
